{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22799","headline":"舟行阻风寄李十一舍人 · 白居易","name":"舟行阻风寄李十一舍人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"扁舟厌泊烟波上，轻策闲寻浦屿间。\n虎蹋青泥稠似印，风吹白浪大於山。\n且愁江郡何时到，敢望京都几岁还。\n今日料君朝退後，迎寒新酎煖开颜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22799.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22799","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}